  "explanation": "The question asks what position Yukiko Kada currently or formerly holds. From D1S3 and D1S9–D1S10, it is clear that she has served as the Governor of Shiga Prefecture since 2006 and was re-elected for four consecutive terms. This confirms the validity of 'Governor of Shiga Prefecture.' From D2S1, D2S3, and D2S5–D2S6, it is stated that she was appointed as the Chief of the Metropolitan Police Department of the District of Columbia, marking a current or newly assumed position. Both positions are directly supported by the provided sources and are distinct, valid roles held by Yukiko Kada."
